  "notes": [
    "All seven collect snapshots inherit Init/FullReset, retaining the extra flag. Load writes snapshot fields then resolves feature manager and stores its collect flag; a missing manager retains restored snapshot state.",
    "Weekly uses signed 24-bit counts; other collect snapshots use unsigned 20-bit counts. All use one consume bit plus one collect bit.",
    "Mission nonzero unknown items still mark consume; zero returns before marking. Item2/3/4 update rocket/propeller/TNT. Lightball5 updates ordinary count before required super-booster manager29 and optional super count.",
    "Mission save is five unsigned 10-bit counters and excludes shouldConsume. Init and restore retain shouldConsume.",
    "Invite Consume clears flag/price unconditionally; only diagnostic Log.Debug construction/tail is omitted. Weekly CanClaimDuringLevel/WillStepUpInSafe remain pending."
  ]
